  "description": "The collector stores the whole response. PolicyDocument holds the inline user policy. The collector replaces it with normalizePolicyDocument(), which url-decodes and parses it into the statement array - so there is no Statement level, and Action and Resource are always arrays. The full stored shape is spelled out here rather than patched onto the sdk shape, so what a plugin may read is visible in one place.",
